    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">1.4.1. Number of member States with newly developed or strengthened institutions, mechanisms or regulatory frameworks for social dialogue, labour relations or dispute prevention/resolution that address current and emerging challenges in the world of work</narrative>
    </title>
